[Music]  two years after a u.s  jury convicted the mexican drug kingpin  known as el chapo  his wife is the newest suspect in the  government's effort to break up the  giant sinaloa  cartel emma coronel aspero was arrested  yesterday at dulles international  airport in virginia  she faces a court hearing today accused  of being part of joaquin guzman's  massive criminal operation as catherine  harris reports  u.s officials may try to use her to  bring more of el chapo's partners  to justice emma cornell aspero  a dual u.s mexico citizen supported her  husband  throughout his brooklyn trial two years  ago now it may be her turn  the 31 year old is charged in a single  count criminal complaint  with conspiracy to distribute cocaine  methamphetamine  heroin and marijuana glizman and his  wife have been together since at least  2007  and shared twin daughters wall street  journal correspondent jose  cordoba has been reporting on el chapo  for more than a decade  she's part of the whole cartel life  she's  been in it all of her life her family's  involved with the cartel  she's cartel royalty in court documents  the justice department also accuses  coronel of helping her husband escape  from a mexican prison in 2015. as  mexico's most powerful drug lord  guzman escaped through an entry under  the shower in his cell  to a mile-long lighted tunnel with a  motorcycle on rails  documents charged that coronell worked  with guzman's sons and a witness  who is now cooperating with authorities  to organize the construction of the  underground tunnel  she was clearly exposed to  all of the things that chapo was in  control of the movement of narcotics  across the border into the united states  and obviously the flow of money back  jack reilly a retired assistant  administrator for the dea  directly tracked el chapo for about 20  years  he says cornell's cooperation could lead  to more arrests  including guzman's suspected second in  command  currently running the sinaloa cartels  operations  right now i think el mayo zimbata is the  number one  drug trafficker in the world and  certainly on our list is terms of  arresting him  and emma cornell could lead us to him  that's what my hope is there is just no  way  that they don't know each other we've  reached out to her lawyers and have not  received a statement about the charges  cornell is expected to appear in court  today via video tony  all right catherine thank you very much

